{
  "id": "6a757731be30e1344b85b15d",
  "title": "株式投資の3文字用語",
  "created": 1786083123,
  "updated": 1786162147,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a757731be30e1344b85b15d",
      "text": "株式投資の3文字用語",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083123,
      "updated": 1786083123
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7577320000000000b9da48",
      "text": "ずっと目が滑ってる[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083123,
      "updated": 1786083132
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75773c0000000000b9da4a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083132,
      "updated": 1786083132
    },
    {
      "id": "6a765f4e0000000000d32092",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786142543,
      "updated": 1786144256
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7665fd0000000000d32098",
      "text": "[https://gyazo.com/dbc3381aadebbc0ac5807fce93c18058]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786144254,
      "updated": 1786144254
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7666050000000000d32099",
      "text": "\t左上の「集金力」などは個人（[Summer498.icon]）の感想",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786144261,
      "updated": 1786144280
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7665f70000000000d32097",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786144248,
      "updated": 1786144248
    },
    {
      "id": "6a765f530000000000d32094",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786142548,
      "updated": 1786142548
    },
    {
      "id": "6a76600d0000000000d32095",
      "text": "[https://gyazo.com/d50246aecef2d0f6576c2f55b0600020]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786142733,
      "updated": 1786142735
    },
    {
      "id": "6a76600f0000000000d32096",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786142735,
      "updated": 1786142735
    },
    {
      "id": "6a765f520000000000d32093",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786142546,
      "updated": 1786142546
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7578b90000000000b9da5e",
      "text": "[EPS]：1株あたり[純利益]（Earnings Per Share）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083513,
      "updated": 1786161139
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7589f30000000000b9da8c",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm EPS}=\\footnotesize\\frac{純利益}{株式発行数}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087924,
      "updated": 1786088043
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7588020000000000b9da81",
      "text": "\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087427,
      "updated": 1786087427
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7587de0000000000b9da7d",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm EPS}=\\footnotesize\\frac{\\rm Earning}{\\rm Share}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087390,
      "updated": 1786087425
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757a8f0000000000b9da67",
      "text": "[BPS]：1株当たり[純資産]（Book-value Per Share）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083983,
      "updated": 1786161144
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7589e90000000000b9da8b",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm BPS}=\\footnotesize\\frac{純資産}{株式発行数}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087913,
      "updated": 1786088045
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7587f80000000000b9da80",
      "text": "\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087417,
      "updated": 1786087417
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7587e70000000000b9da7e",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm BPS}=\\footnotesize\\frac{\\rm Book\\text-value}{\\rm Share}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087400,
      "updated": 1786087434
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75773c0000000000b9da4b",
      "text": "[PER]：[株価収益率]（Price Earnings Ratio）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083132,
      "updated": 1786161119
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7585670000000000b9da79",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm PER}={\\footnotesize\\frac{株価}{\\rm EPS}}={\\footnotesize株価\\times\\frac{株式発行数}{純利益}}={\\footnotesize\\frac{時価総額}{純利益}}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786086759,
      "updated": 1786161184
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7588270000000000b9da83",
      "text": "\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087463,
      "updated": 1786087467
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75882a0000000000b9da84",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm PER}={\\footnotesize\\frac{\\rm Price}{\\rm EPS}}={\\footnotesize\\rm Price\\times\\frac{Share}{\\rm Earnings}}={\\footnotesize\\frac{\\rm Market\\ Capitalization}{\\rm Earnings}}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087466,
      "updated": 1786161232
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75773b0000000000b9da49",
      "text": "[PBR]：[株価純資産倍率]（Price Book-value Ratio）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083132,
      "updated": 1786161116
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75860f0000000000b9da7a",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm PBR}={\\footnotesize\\frac{株価}{\\rm BPS}}={\\footnotesize株価\\times\\frac{株式発行数}{純資産}}={\\footnotesize\\frac{時価総額}{純資産}}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786086928,
      "updated": 1786161194
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7588eb0000000000b9da85",
      "text": "\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087660,
      "updated": 1786087662
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7588ed0000000000b9da86",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm PER}={\\footnotesize\\frac{\\rm Price}{\\rm BPS}}={\\footnotesize\\rm Price\\times\\frac{Share}{\\rm Book\\text-value}}={\\footnotesize\\frac{\\rm Market\\ Capitalization}{\\rm Book\\text-value}}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087661,
      "updated": 1786161243
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7577480000000000b9da4d",
      "text": "[ROA]：[総資産利益率]（Return On Assets）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083144,
      "updated": 1786161114
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7586d70000000000b9da7b",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm ROA}={\\footnotesize\\frac{純利益}{総資産}}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087127,
      "updated": 1786087203
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7589410000000000b9da88",
      "text": "\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087745,
      "updated": 1786087746
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7589320000000000b9da87",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm ROA}=\\footnotesize\\frac{\\rm Retrun}{\\rm Assets}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087730,
      "updated": 1786087765
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75774b0000000000b9da4e",
      "text": "[ROE]：[自己資本利益率]（Return On Equity）",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083148,
      "updated": 1786161111
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7587350000000000b9da7c",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm ROE}={\\footnotesize\\frac{純利益}{自己資本}}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087221,
      "updated": 1786087257
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75895c0000000000b9da89",
      "text": "\t",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087772,
      "updated": 1786087774
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75895c0000000000b9da8a",
      "text": "\t[$ {\\rm ROE}=\\footnotesize\\frac{\\rm Return}{\\rm Equity}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786087773,
      "updated": 1786087805
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7577440000000000b9da4c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083140,
      "updated": 1786083140
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7578570000000000b9da59",
      "text": "関連用語",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083416,
      "updated": 1786083421
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7578eb0000000000b9da5f",
      "text": "\t[純利益]：Earnings",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083563,
      "updated": 1786161108
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7578f30000000000b9da60",
      "text": "\t\t稼いだ金額",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083572,
      "updated": 1786083577
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7579010000000000b9da61",
      "text": "\t[株式]：Share",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083586,
      "updated": 1786161106
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757ab50000000000b9da68",
      "text": "\t\t[発行済株式数]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084022,
      "updated": 1786161326
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757a5a0000000000b9da63",
      "text": "\t[株価]：Price",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083931,
      "updated": 1786161102
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757b270000000000b9da6c",
      "text": "\t\t時間に従って変化する",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084136,
      "updated": 1786084196
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75785d0000000000b9da5b",
      "text": "\t[帳簿価額]：Book Value",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083421,
      "updated": 1786161100
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7578790000000000b9da5d",
      "text": "\t\t会計上で記録された[資産]や[負債]の[評価額]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083449,
      "updated": 1786161366
    },
    {
      "id": "6a75786c0000000000b9da5c",
      "text": "\t[総資産]：Assets",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083437,
      "updated": 1786161086
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757bd90000000000b9da6d",
      "text": "\t\t会計上に記録されるすべての[資産]の合計",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084313,
      "updated": 1786161358
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757bf30000000000b9da6e",
      "text": "\t\t[負債]＋[純資産]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084339,
      "updated": 1786161345
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757bff0000000000b9da6f",
      "text": "\t\t[負債]は借りた分は手元に金銭を保持してバフがかかっているイメージ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084352,
      "updated": 1786161354
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757a210000000000b9da62",
      "text": "\t[自己資本]：Equity",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786083874,
      "updated": 1786161090
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757ad00000000000b9da69",
      "text": " 組み合わせ",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084049,
      "updated": 1786143470
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757ad50000000000b9da6b",
      "text": " \t[時価総額]：[発行済み株式数][$ \\times][株価]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084054,
      "updated": 1786161384
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757ad10000000000b9da6a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084049,
      "updated": 1786084863
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757dff0000000000b9da71",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084863,
      "updated": 1786084863
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757e070000000000b9da72",
      "text": "「[貸借対照表]のここに書くもの」を複数の用語で読んでいるからややこしい！",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084871,
      "updated": 1786161077
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757e4c0000000000b9da74",
      "text": "[https://gyazo.com/2f1a4e2524dafd0347fd1b1fd5fee46f]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084941,
      "updated": 1786086649
    },
    {
      "id": "6a757e170000000000b9da73",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786084887,
      "updated": 1786084887
    },
    {
      "id": "6a758aef0000000000b9da8d",
      "text": "この値って素朴に考えるとどういう解釈が良いかな",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786088176,
      "updated": 1786088192
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7693c500000000001792ac",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1786155974,
      "updated": 1786155974
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7693c600000000001792ad",
      "text": "[会計基準]むずい[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1786155974,
      "updated": 1786155988
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7693d400000000001792ae",
      "text": " そもそも何種類かある",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1786155988,
      "updated": 1786155993
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7693f700000000001792af",
      "text": " [日本会計基準]、[IFRS]、[米国会計基準]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786156023,
      "updated": 1786158826
    },
    {
      "id": "6a76941b00000000001792b0",
      "text": "  たしか種類によって呼び名、概念、計算方法が微妙に違う",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1786156060,
      "updated": 1786156164
    },
    {
      "id": "6a758b000000000000b9da8e",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786088192,
      "updated": 1786088192
    },
    {
      "id": "6a76abe00000000000664428",
      "text": "まとめありがたい[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1786162145,
      "updated": 1786162147
    },
    {
      "id": "6a76abe20000000000664429",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1786162147,
      "updated": 1786162147
    }
  ]
}